</nav>
<div class="page">
  <h1>18+ Content Compliance</h1>
  <div class="date">ThePaywall age verification and consent policy</div>

  <div class="highlight">
    <p>Posting adult content without completing verification is prohibited. This process protects you legally and ensures all content on the platform is consensual and involves adults only.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Why we require this</h2>
  <p>Under the South African Films and Publications Act (as amended), distributing sexual content involving persons under 18 is a serious criminal offence. Our verification process creates a record that protects you as a creator if your content is ever investigated.</p>
  <p>You keep private records — buyers never see your ID or personal details.</p>

  <h2>The verification process</h2>
  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-num">1</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h3>Submit your ID</h3>
      <p>Upload a photo or scan of your South African ID, passport, or driver's licence. This confirms you are 18+ and establishes your identity as the account holder.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-num">2</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h3>Sign the declaration</h3>
      <p>You digitally sign a declaration confirming: (a) you are 18+, (b) all persons in your content are 18+, and (c) all persons have given consent to the content being distributed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-num">3</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h3>Keep records of co-performers</h3>
      <p>If your content features other people, you must hold copies of their IDs and written consent. You do not upload these to us — you keep them privately in case verification is ever required.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-num">4</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h3>Approval and posting</h3>
      <p>Once verified, your account is approved for 18+ content. Verification is reviewed within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>What we store</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your ID document — encrypted, stored securely, never displayed publicly</li>
    <li>Your signed declaration with timestamp</li>
    <li>Your date of birth for age confirmation</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Zero tolerance</h2>
  <p>Any content involving minors will result in immediate account termination, permanent ban, and reporting to the South African Police Service and the Film and Publication Board. There are no exceptions.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>For compliance questions: compliance@thepaywall.co.za</p>
</div>
</body>
